<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#UnderlyingRiskDriverFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "It refers to the (non-climatic) risk drivers that may significantly alter the socio-economic or environmental situations and possibly amplify the negative consequences of impacts by acting on their determinants (e.g., vulnerability or exposure) but cannot be mitigated or controlled within the scope of the Impact Chain model."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core> .
