<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ImpactsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impacts on"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#daysToWeeks> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Example: Dengue infection leading to health deterioration."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#daysToWeeks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ConnectionTimeLag> .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#minutesToHours> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Example: An Earthquake (hazard) can trigger (leads to) a landslide."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#VulnerabilityFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "INFORM.MOVE Framework (https://drmkc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/inform-index/INFORM-Risk/Methodology - Birkmann et al., 2013) (both for risk assessment but incl. Classification of vulnerability components)."@en .
