<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ImpactsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'Impacts on' connection of an Impact Chain model. Indicates mainly a relationship between an impact and an exposed asset. Links an Impact factor to an Exposure factor. Example: An increase in power outages (Impact) impacts industries (Exposure)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#directAffects> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'Affects connection' represented through an object property directly linking the involved factors, in addition to a reified relationship individual."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#isAbout> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ImpactChainConnection> .
