<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ExposureFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exposure factor of an Impact Chain model."@en .
_:nfd2b7f90ef50431a978bf28b52752b05b51 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#Mitigates> .
